WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Teddy waves hello.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Teddy rests his cheek while waiting.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Teddy taps his tablet.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Teddy adjusts his glasses for a closer look.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Teddy makes a small hop.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Teddy turns his head through sixteen directions.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Teddy rests with his tablet.
